# Regression test placeholder: E043 ResourceLimitExceeded (MAX_STRING_SIZE path)
# This test documents that MAX_STRING_SIZE has no dedicated corpus test. The limit
# cannot be triggered via corpus tests because its threshold is too large to reach
# with a fixed input.
#
# NOTE: E043 is now triggerable via corpus for the MAX_COLLECT_SIZE path.
# See tests/corpus/eval/errors/collect_infinite_seq.llt-eval which triggers E043
# via [collect [range 0]] (an infinite sequence).
#
# BACKGROUND: E043 was added in Cycle #40 (2026-04-27) for resource-guard errors.
# MAX_COLLECT_SIZE is enforced in collect_infinite_seq.llt-eval; MAX_STRING_SIZE
# is enforced only in unit tests where the limit can be set to a small value.
#
# NOTE: This is NOT an error test (expected output is successful evaluation).
# It was moved from tests/corpus/eval/errors/ where it didn't belong.

# Create a small dict (does NOT trigger E043)
[large: [a: 1  b: 2  c: 3]]
=== out
["large": ["a": 1  "b": 2  "c": 3]]
